        "problem": "$\\int (5\\operatorname{csch}\u2061y\\operatorname{coth}\u2061y+3\\operatorname{cosh}\u2061y)\\text{d}y=$",
        "worked_solution": "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}y}(\\operatorname{sinh}\u2061y)=\\operatorname{cosh}\u2061y & \\,\u21d2\\,\\int \\operatorname{cosh}\u2061y\\,\\text{d}y=\\operatorname{sinh}\u2061y+C, \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}y}(\\operatorname{csch}\u2061y)=-\\operatorname{csch}\u2061y\\operatorname{coth}\u2061y & \\,\u21d2\\,\\int \\operatorname{csch}\u2061y\\operatorname{coth}\u2061y\\,\\text{d}y=-\\operatorname{csch}\u2061y+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (5\\operatorname{csch}\u2061y\\operatorname{coth}\u2061y+3\\operatorname{cosh}\u2061y)\\text{d}y & =\\int 5\\operatorname{csch}\u2061y\\operatorname{coth}\u2061y\\,\\text{d}y+\\int 3\\operatorname{cosh}\u2061y\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =5\\int \\operatorname{csch}\u2061y\\operatorname{coth}\u2061y\\,\\text{d}y+3\\int \\operatorname{cosh}\u2061y\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =5(-\\operatorname{csch}\u2061y)+3\\operatorname{sinh}\u2061y+C \\\\  & =3\\operatorname{sinh}\u2061y-5\\operatorname{csch}\u2061y+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
